# DietPi Hosted Homelab: Step-by-Step Fully Automated Setup Guide

This guide details how to build a highly optimized, fully automated, and headless Raspberry Pi homelab server running **DietPi**, **Docker**, **Portainer**, and **Homer Dashboard** [125, 163, 172]. 

Rather than executing commands manually on a terminal, we will leverage **DietPi's built-in automation engine** (`dietpi.txt` and `dietpi-wifi.txt`) and custom first-boot scripting (`Automation_Custom_Script.sh`) to achieve a **zero-touch, completely headless deployment** [638, 640, 641, 642].

